<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Feb inflation 1.8 pct y/y, 0.4 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Austrian Feb inflation 1.8 pct y/y, 0.4 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following provisional economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	   FEBRUARY*   JANUARY     FEB 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	 0.4	   n.a.	  0.5</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     1.8	   1.7	   1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1996)	    101.1	 100.7	 129.6**</p>
<p>NOTE - * provisional figures</p>
<p>	  ** base 1986 -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 256</p>
